	(gr_text "Tayloe-Based Software Defined Radio\nRevision 1.0\n\nMCU: STM32G431RBT6\n\nWorking Freq: 0.5MHz - 30MHz\nBandwidth: ~32KHz\n\nFilter Banks (select bpf 1, select bpf 2)\n (0 0) -> 0.5 - 1.8MHz\n (0 1) -> 1.8 - 4.2MHz\n (1 0) -> 4.2 - 10.8MHz\n (1 1) -> 10.5 - 30MHz"
